{"evidence":[{"pdf_page":73,"quote":"NCC\u2019s long-term target is to achieve net-zero emissions by 2045, which replaces the previous target of climate neutrality by 2045. What this entails is an actual reduction of greenhouse gas emissions of at least 90 percent and the remaining reduction through relevant offsets. NCC\u2019s efforts to reduce GHG emissions have been under way for several years, with a particular focus on its own Scope 1 and 2 emissions as well as the materials in Scope 3 with the greatest impact.","source_id":"KB-B030-NCC-ASR2025"}],"knowledge_status":"reference_candidate","predicate":{"canonical_key":"evidence_snippet_ghg_emissions","raw_key":"ghg_emissions"},"promotion":{"eligible":false,"reason":"requires_atomic_projection_and_independent_evidence_gate"},"provenance":{"reference_status":"mineru_exact_quote_pending_semantic_projection","simulated":false,"source_artifact":"artifacts/scale_batch_030/mineru_targets_RESUME01/KB-B030-NCC-ASR2025-p0073/ncc-annual-and-sustainability-report-2025/auto/ncc-annual-and-sustainability-report-2025.md","source_sha256":"b467093f8810141a1a6af6740bd29afa4f6058c21c2315da3b73e038c240dff8"},"qualifiers":{"answer_status":"unverified_evidence_candidate","calculation_expression":null,"normalized_unit":null,"period_literal":"2025","reference_period":2025,"scope_boundary":null,"value_origin":"issuer_disclosure_extracted"},"record_id":"fact-bc83c34543db477375b93a61","record_kind":"fact","schema_version":"0.1","subject":{"document_ids":["KB-B030-NCC-ASR2025"],"document_metadata":[{"company":"NCC AB (publ)","document_id":"KB-B030-NCC-ASR2025","language":"English","local_path":"data/raw/scale_batch_030/ncc-annual-and-sustainability-report-2025.pdf","sha256":"253f5b9bf6a12ec5ce7e1965711dcda91af42da1bd58cb37972b5d87af853de2","title":"NCC Annual and Sustainability Report 2025"}],"entity_label":"NCC AB (publ)","task_id":"KB-B028-KB-B030-NCC-ASR2025-P0073-GHG_EMISSIONS-1"},"trust_tier":"C","value":"NCC\u2019s long-term target is to achieve net-zero emissions by 2045, which replaces the previous target of climate neutrality by 2045. What this entails is an actual reduction of greenhouse gas emissions of at least 90 percent and the remaining reduction through relevant offsets. NCC\u2019s efforts to reduce GHG emissions have been under way for several years, with a particular focus on its own Scope 1 and 2 emissions as well as the materials in Scope 3 with the greatest impact."}
{"evidence":[{"pdf_page":73,"quote":"In 2024 and 2025, NCC has worked on mapping all emissions in the value chain with a particular focus on collecting and analyzing supplier data. Emissions from the purchase of goods and services comprise the majority of NCC\u2019s emissions, and Scope 3 data quality and data access remain a challenge. It is therefore important to continuously develop data collection methods to reduce reliance on spend-based calculations.","source_id":"KB-B030-NCC-ASR2025"}],"knowledge_status":"reference_candidate","predicate":{"canonical_key":"evidence_snippet_ghg_emissions","raw_key":"ghg_emissions"},"promotion":{"eligible":false,"reason":"requires_atomic_projection_and_independent_evidence_gate"},"provenance":{"reference_status":"mineru_exact_quote_pending_semantic_projection","simulated":false,"source_artifact":"artifacts/scale_batch_030/mineru_targets_RESUME01/KB-B030-NCC-ASR2025-p0073/ncc-annual-and-sustainability-report-2025/auto/ncc-annual-and-sustainability-report-2025.md","source_sha256":"b467093f8810141a1a6af6740bd29afa4f6058c21c2315da3b73e038c240dff8"},"qualifiers":{"answer_status":"unverified_evidence_candidate","calculation_expression":null,"normalized_unit":null,"period_literal":"2025","reference_period":2025,"scope_boundary":null,"value_origin":"issuer_disclosure_extracted"},"record_id":"fact-2eb935bdfe07f4b05de2f379","record_kind":"fact","schema_version":"0.1","subject":{"document_ids":["KB-B030-NCC-ASR2025"],"document_metadata":[{"company":"NCC AB (publ)","document_id":"KB-B030-NCC-ASR2025","language":"English","local_path":"data/raw/scale_batch_030/ncc-annual-and-sustainability-report-2025.pdf","sha256":"253f5b9bf6a12ec5ce7e1965711dcda91af42da1bd58cb37972b5d87af853de2","title":"NCC Annual and Sustainability Report 2025"}],"entity_label":"NCC AB (publ)","task_id":"KB-B028-KB-B030-NCC-ASR2025-P0073-GHG_EMISSIONS-2"},"trust_tier":"C","value":"In 2024 and 2025, NCC has worked on mapping all emissions in the value chain with a particular focus on collecting and analyzing supplier data. Emissions from the purchase of goods and services comprise the majority of NCC\u2019s emissions, and Scope 3 data quality and data access remain a challenge. It is therefore important to continuously develop data collection methods to reduce reliance on spend-based calculations."}
