ro emissions by 2045, which replaces the previous target of climate neutrality by 2045. What this entails is an actual reduction of greenhouse gas emissions of at least 90 percent and the remaining reduction through relevant offsets. NCC\u2019s efforts to reduce GHG emissions have been under way for several years, with a particular focus on its own Scope 1 and 2 emissions as well as the materials in Scope 3 with the greatest impact."}
{"evidence":[{"pdf_page":73,"quote":"In order to include emission reductions already achieved in the process of setting the 2030 targets, NCC has chosen to have a reference value based on 2024 but incorporating data from 2020. Data from 2020 is based on specific supplier data for fuel, energy, ready-mix concrete and reinforcement steel. NCC\u2019s reference target for 2030 are science based in accordance with the reduction rate required for keeping global warming below 1.5\u00b0C, in accordance with the Paris Agreement.","source_id":"KB-B030-NCC-ASR2025"}],"knowledge_status":"reference_candidate","predicate":{"canonical_key":"evidence_snippet_targets","raw_key":"targets"},"promotion":{"eligible":false,"reason":"requires_atomic_projection_and_independent_evidence_gate"},"provenance":{"reference_status":"mineru_exact_quote_pending_semantic_projection","simulated":false,"source_artifact":"artifacts/scale_batch_030/mineru_targets_RESUME01/KB-B030-NCC-ASR2025-p0073/ncc-annual-and-sustainability-report-2025/auto/ncc-annual-and-sustainability-report-2025.md","source_sha256":"b467093f8810141a1a6af6740bd29afa4f6058c21c2315da3b73e038c240dff8"},"qualifiers":{"answer_status":"unverified_evidence_candidate","calculation_expression":null,"normalized_unit":null,"period_literal":"2025","reference_period":2025,"scope_boundary":null,"value_origin":"issuer_disclosure_extracted"},"record_id":"fact-f8c3318d85c523ca6ac5b05f","record_kind":"fact","schema_version":"0.1","subject":{"document_ids":["KB-B030-NCC-ASR2025"],"document_metadata":[{"company":"NCC AB (publ)","document_id":"KB-B030-NCC-ASR2025","language":"English","local_path":"data/raw/scale_batch_030/ncc-annual-and-sustainability-report-2025.pdf","sha256":"253f5b9bf6a12ec5ce7e1965711dcda91af42da1bd58cb37972b5d87af853de2","title":"NCC Annual and Sustainability Report 2025"}],"entity_label":"NCC AB (publ)","task_id":"KB-B028-KB-B030-NCC-ASR2025-P0073-TARGETS-2"},"trust_tier":"C","value":"In order to include emission reductions already achieved in the process of setting the 2030 targets, NCC has chosen to have a reference value based on 2024 but incorporating data from 2020. Data from 2020 is based on specific supplier data for fuel, energy, ready-mix concrete and reinforcement steel. NCC\u2019s reference target for 2030 are science based in accordance with the reduction rate required for keeping global warming below 1.5\u00b0C, in accordance with the Paris Agreement."}
{"evidence":[{"pdf_page":74,"quote":"Data on purchases of fuel, electricity, heating energy and cooling energy is collected to the greatest extent possible directly from NCC suppliers. To ensure a full coverage rate, this data is supplemented by a spend-based calculation. Refer to Reporting principles for collection of data in Scope 1 and 2. All the data collected is restated to energy using net heating value.","source_id":"KB-B030-NCC-ASR2025"}],"knowledge_status":"reference_candidate","predicate":{"canonical_key":"evidence_snippet_energy","raw_key":"energy"},"promotion":{"eligible":false,"reason":"requires_atomic_projection_and_independent_evidence_gate"},"provenance":{"reference_status":"mineru_exact_quote_pending_semantic_projection","simulated":false,"source_artifact":"artifacts/scale_batch_030/mineru_targets_RESUME03/KB-B030-NCC-ASR2025-p0074/ncc-annual-and-sustainability-report-2025/auto/ncc-annual-and-sustainability-report-2025.md","source_sha256":"ba74013ce32a3493e3cae62ce4893ad53e4f08c05cd8e17783f6b25c22805bac"},"qualifiers":{"answer_status":"unverified_evidence_candidate","calculation_expression":null,"normalized_unit":null,"period_literal":"2025","reference_period":2025,"scope_boundary":null,"value_origin":"issuer_disclosure_extracted"},"record_id":"fact-4b95251f1daa1726ac0d7352","record_kind":"fact","schema_version":"0.1","subject":{"document_ids":["KB-B030-NCC-ASR2025"],"document_metadata":[{"company":"NCC AB (publ)","document_id":"KB-B030-NCC-ASR2025","language":"English","local_path":"data/raw/scale_batch_030/ncc-annual-and-sustainability-report-2025.pdf","sha256":"253f5b9bf6a12ec5ce7e1965711dcda91af42da1bd58cb37972b5d87af853de2","title":"NCC Annual and Sustainability Report 2025"}],"entity_label":"NCC AB (publ)","task_id":"KB-B028-KB-B030-NCC-ASR2025-P0074-ENERGY-1"},"trust_tier":"C","value":"Data on purchases of fuel, electricity, heating energy and cooling energy is collected to the greatest extent possible directly from NCC suppliers. To ensure a full coverage rate, this data is supplemented by a spend-based calculation. Refer to Reporting principles for collection of data in Scope 1 and 2. All the data collected is restated to energy using net heating value."}
